<title>Introductie op Teambuilding</title>
</head>
<body><h2><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW236100706 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; "><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="1022167558" paraeid="{ece05d08-e522-4498-80e8-d10eda9e74a9}{216}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">T</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ea</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">mbuildin</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">g</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">, of co</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">mmunity</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">vorming</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ligt aan de kern van </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> werken. De </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">hieropvolgende</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">pagina's </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">in </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">het</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">basis</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">k</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">amp vertellen je meer over de verschillende dimensies van samenwerken in e</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">en </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplina</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> omgeving.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;

</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="1935929765" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{9}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Om te beginnen bij de basis. Teambuilding is </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">op </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">twee</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> vlakken een essentieel onderdeel van </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> projecten: binnen je projectgroep</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">en vanuit je project richting zo veel mogelijk relevante stakeholders. </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="327443528" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{31}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Om te beginnen bij</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> je</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> eigen groep: dat samenwerken een kunst op zich is, heb je vast al vaak ervaren. Toch komen we er in deze TRAIL vaak op terug. Samenwerken in een </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> team is extra ingewikkeld door de diversiteit aan teamleden: verschillen die </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">je</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> uiteindelijk </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">moet </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">samenvoegen tot innovatieve kennis.&nbsp;</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="1493688996" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{55}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Ten tweede </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">is het belangrijk om vanaf de start </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">te werken aan je sociale relaties met het ‘veld’ rondom </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">het </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">maatschappelijk probleem</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">. Dit veld helpt je de uitdaging beter te begrijpe</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">n en oplossingen te bedenken</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Het uitbreiden van je netwerk helpt</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> bovendien</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> bij het vinden van de juiste nieuwe mensen om in het projectteam mee te werken.&nbsp;</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="512657451" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{83}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Het </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">is belangrijk om</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> bij </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> werken </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">scherp te blijven op </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ontbrekende </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">deelnemers </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">en perspectieven</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">. Wanneer je een coördinerende rol op je neemt, is het aan jou en je team om te beslissen hoe je </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">stakeholders </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">vervolgens bij het project betrekt: als adviseur, sparringpartner, lokale gids of onderzoeker. </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;

</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="1344388687" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{125}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">Onder </span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">kopje theorie</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">vind je inzichten uit wetenschappelijke onderzoeken naar teambuilding, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">en de motivatie van deelnemers om mee te doen aan </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; bac