NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">De </span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">praktijk-pagina</span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"> biedt binnenkort enkele tools en aanpakken die je kan gebruiken om aan groepsvorming te werken.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="EOP SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW20965493 BCX8" paraid="1859454729" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{147}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;  font-style: italic;  font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Let op</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">: </span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;  font-style: italic;  font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Verdiepingspagina's voor de theorie en praktijk zijn nog niet </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">volledig </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">beschikbaar op dit onderwerp. Momenteel werken enkele auteurs van de </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">Trail</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">-tool aan een review-studie naar </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> samenwerkingen. Kennis uit deze studie wordt hier binnenkort </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">toegevoegd</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Kijk hier alvast voor een introductie van dit nieuwe onderzoek en de </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">onderzoek</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">er</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">: </span></span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Hyperlink SCXW20965493 BCX8" href="https://www.avans.nl/onderzoek/projecten/detail/scoping-review-transdisciplinaire-samenwerkingen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun Underlined SCXW20965493 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(70, 120, 134);  text-decoration-line: underline;  font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Scoping</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> review transdisciplinaire samenwerkingen | </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Avans</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW20965493 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle